# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Lekhok Forum — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development
# (never commit .env.local to git)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Local development (no Turso = sql.js disk-based SQLite) ──
# TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://your-db.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_turso_token_here
# SESSION_SECRET=change-this-to-a-long-random-string
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=vercel_blob_token_here

# ── Email (Resend — newsletter + forgot/reset password) ──
# RESEND_API_KEY  = API key from resend.com/keys  (required to actually SEND;
#                   without it, emails are queued but not delivered, and the
#                   forgot-password reset link only logs to the server console)
# NEWSLETTER_FROM = verified sender, e.g. "লেখক ফোরাম <info@lekhokforum.org>"
#                   (must use a domain verified at resend.com/domains — SPF+DKIM)
# SITE_URL        = public base URL for article/unsubscribe/reset links
#   RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#   NEWSLETTER_FROM=লেখক ফোরাম <info@lekhokforum.org>
#   SITE_URL=https://lekhok-forum.vercel.app
